{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2021-02-22 14:30:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE CREDIT SUISSE 22ND ANNUAL FINANCIAL SERVICES FORUM', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 22, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHRIS CONCANNON, PRESIDENT AND COO, AND TONY DELISE, CFO, ARE SCHEDULED TO SPEAK AT THE CREDIT SUISSE 22ND ANNUAL FINANCIAL SERVICES FORUM AT 2:40 P.M. EST ON FEBRUARY 24, 2021.'}